        "content": {
          "content_type": "text",
          "parts": [
            "A blue dot next to one of your conversations simply means **there’s something new in that thread that you haven’t opened yet**.\n\nDepending on the situation, it can mean:\n\n- **You have an unread reply** from the assistant.  \n- **The conversation was updated** (for example, restored after a crash or sync).  \n- **A system notice or change** was added to that thread.\n\nOnce you tap/open the conversation, the blue dot disappears.\n\nIf you're seeing the dot persist after opening, tell me—there are a couple of reasons that can happen too."
          ]
